WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.340
If your hair is still falling out after everything you've tried, honey, this is what you've been missing.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:16.860
This was her hair before, and this is her hair after just one month of me treating her right here in my salon chair.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.640
Grate one full piece of fresh ginger root into a bowl.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:29.880
Add a tablespoon of castor oil, one tablespoon of raw honey, and the juice of Haffa lemon.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.380
Stir it together and work it directly into your scalp for three minutes.

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.500
Leave it on for 45 minutes, then rinse.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:44.100
Together, these four ingredients increase blood circulation to every dormant follicle.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:50.040
Rebuild damaged strands and strip away every layer of buildup that has been blocking your

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.080
growth for years.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:57.160
Behind this chair, I have turned around some of the worst cases of thinning I have ever

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:57.740
seen.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:04.520
And this treatment is always where I start because when the scalp is white, everything else follows.

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:08.280
Do this twice a week for 30 days and I promise you will thank me later.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:12.080
Comment growth and I will send you more salon treatments you can do right at home.

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.280
And follow me for more.
